# What must never leave this machine.
#
# .gitignore does NOT apply here. The publisher walks the module directory with
# its own default list, and .gitignore is itself on that list, so it is never
# even read. Without this file, `railcall market module sign .` signed 24 files
# including .secrets/okta.json, which holds the Okta private key, and
# .secrets/marketplace_publisher.backup.json, which holds the publisher signing
# seed. Publishing would have uploaded both.
#
# tools/check_publishable.py fails the build if anything below reappears in the
# signed tree, because a rule nobody checks lasts until the next hurried edit.

.secrets/
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*.json
keys.local.json
live_findings*.json
.venv/
venv/
env/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
